---
import BaseHead from '../components/BaseHead.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
import { AUTHOR_EMAIL } from '../consts';
---

<html lang="en">
	<head>
		<BaseHead
			title="About · Kenrick Tjandra"
			description="A short introduction. Robotics engineer at Raise Robotics, occasional travel writer."
		/>
	</head>
	<body>
		<Header />
		<main>
			<section class="hero">
				<h1>About</h1>
				<p class="lede">
					I'm Kenrick. I build robots, mostly the kind that pick things up and put them somewhere
					else.
				</p>
			</section>

			<p>
				I work as a robotics engineer at <a href="https://raiserobotics.ai">Raise Robotics</a>, where
				I focus on manipulation stacks &mdash; the stretch from a camera frame to a gripper closing
				on the right thing in the right pose. Most of my time goes to perception, motion planning,
				and the patient debugging that keeps real hardware honest.
			</p>

			<p>
				Outside of that I write. Travel notes from places I keep going back to, occasional opinions
				on engineering and the way it gets practiced. I prefer specific writing over the general
				kind.
			</p>

			<p>
				The fastest way to reach me is email: <a href={`mailto:${AUTHOR_EMAIL}`}>{AUTHOR_EMAIL}</a>.
			</p>

			<hr />

			<p class="section-label">Colophon</p>
			<p>
				This site is built with <a href="https://astro.build">Astro</a>, hosted on Cloudflare
				Pages, and set in <a href="https://fonts.google.com/specimen/Source+Serif+4">Source Serif
				4</a> with <a href="https://rsms.me/inter/">Inter</a> for the chrome. The source is on
				GitHub.
			</p>
		</main>
		<Footer />
	</body>
</html>
